# IELTS Speaking Part 1
# Topic 4: Celebrity
**Target Band:** 7.5–8.5

---

# Vocabulary

| Word/Phrase | Meaning |
|--------------|---------|
| celebrity | a famous person |
| public figure | someone well known by the public |
| role model | someone people admire and imitate |
| influencer | someone who influences others, especially online |
| global icon | a person famous around the world |
| accomplished | highly skilled and successful |
| charitable work | activities that help people |
| inspire | motivate someone positively |
| public image | how the public sees someone |
| media attention | attention from TV, newspapers, or social media |
| privacy | the right to keep one's personal life private |
| controversy | public disagreement or criticism |
| admiration | great respect |
| humanitarian | a person who helps others |

