# Common Mistakes

❌ I like Shah Rukh Khan because he is very famous.

✅ I admire Shah Rukh Khan because of his outstanding acting skills and humble personality.

---

❌ Celebrities have many money.

✅ Many celebrities earn substantial amounts of money.

---

❌ I want become celebrity.

✅ I would like to become a well-respected professional rather than a celebrity.

---

# Band 8+ Tip

Always explain **why** you admire someone.

### ❌ Basic

> I like Ronaldo.

### ✅ Better

> I admire Cristiano Ronaldo because of his extraordinary work ethic, discipline, and determination. His journey from a modest background to becoming one of the world's greatest footballers is genuinely inspiring.

